    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Stéphanie Lacroix",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116445501139890572990/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUp3hFMJWLWZJDNe2VYp9Awab9qVhRQL8A0HjzEOUzUsqUtXrN-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "A huge thank you to Grace the manager and her team for being so kind, patient and passionate about what they do. I had a frustrating issue with a pick up from another store and Grace helped me in the most professional manner, fixed my order and helped me get the chairs I wanted. I don’t live close to this store but I will be definitely make the trip over there for my next purchases at Bouclair. Thank you so much, you guys are a wonderful and hardworking team 🤍",
        "time": 1763224704,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Hossein Kassaei",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100321605701129807591/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJkcigGwpIXPfPxz84eMV4jS_eaDW83kEbKo2U4TJxOyC65-Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We bought a couple of armchairs and a side table. The products are very nice-looking in the showroom but they have very poor quality. The worst part is the assembly. As for the chairs, you need to screw the legs to the body but the holes are not aligned. We spend an hour assembling one with so much trouble and ended up returning the second one because the holes on the leg and body were off by more than an inch!\n\nWhen we returned the chair to the store (40 min drive) and asked for another one, they said we needed to order online and go pick up another day and They don’t offer free shipment.\n\nThe side table wasn’t any better. As I’m writing this, we’re planning to return it and we won’t buy from this store again!",
        "time": 1768084382,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Francine Bourdeu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113096438914946774838/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXl8ck_DzTa1sn2Bs4rx2H-uD1Kk3Z2L-29rp0gaq9cvbWHhss=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I love everything about this store! The staff is so nice and the furniture is great quality!",
        "time": 1763787473,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Freda K",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105284561524267742227/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIjQo7U0O8z4kSz1KtWNM568a_kEK5Sz9bwRQvWCav19WXPJw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I'm new in the area. Went to buy drapes. Well I was so undecided between the white or green. The staff in this store AMAZING. So understanding and helpful. Koodos to the training. The store is comfortable and not hard to find assistance. Thank you girls wonderful first experience 💓.",
        "time": 1746102837,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lloyd Mckay",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101754844841778074721/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJLTtf3AXk6YKlUCJMyszVn22xqLqGdm5AgbOnZtqe8xqxWGg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The staff and especially the manager Alexandra are super helpful. She was knowledgeable and kind. Even though they didn't have exactly what I was looking for, I bought a green tea candle and it smelt great!",
        "time": 1730224697,
        "translated": false
      }
